internal/engine, internal/audio and their test harness port the listener
engine, player, ring buffer, resampler, transcript clean-up and echo
simulation of
wonky-talkie (Copyright 2026 Drew Bednar), https://github.com/androiddrew/wonky-talkie.

Test clips in internal/engine/testdata are real speech from openWakeWord
(https://github.com/dscripka/openWakeWord, Apache-2.0); see its README.md.

Test clips in internal/wake/testdata are from go-phonmatchnet v0.1.0's
fixtures: synthesized with Kokoro-82M v1.0 (Apache-2.0), voice af_heart,
resampled to 16 kHz.

Echo cancellation uses go-speexdsp (BSD-3-Clause), a Go port of SpeexDSP
1.2.1's echo canceller and preprocessor, https://github.com/androiddrew/go-speexdsp.
